From e7c6861561c5491217a8a8e8c026f7178f04ca0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Max R <max8rr8@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] d3d10umd: Viogpu for windows improvements

Overall improvements:
* Create screen in CreateDevice not OpenAdapter
* Integrate with gdikmt
* Use flush_buffer to Present data on screen
* Improve RotateResourceIdentities implementation to avoid blit
* Implement SetDisplayMode
* Implement FormatDeTranslate to get DxgiFormat from pipe_format
* Improve resource bind flags generation

Virgl related improvements, might be a bit hacky:
* Unset shared flag on RotateResourceIdentities temp_resource
* Remove use of dummy vertex buffers
* Use constant buffers starting from 1 (0 seems to be reserved only for user buffers)
* Use address registers in generated TGSI code
* Use old texture ops for virgl
